rsonal life\\n\\nChurch lives on ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Haden_Church\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2013, Canto made his debut in American television, playing the role of Paul Torres on the Fox drama series, The Following. In 2015 Canto played real life politician Rodrigo Lara Bonia in Netflix drama series Narcos. In 2016, he was cast in the ABC political drama series ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2024&ref_=nmbio\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1cf3366ca980792353d9e303a7333b9356c90a4f2499e4bd511b38627ac228ce\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"db949760145735b645ca634be889aff8a42a252f47bbccbcf3621e125380f981\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor plays alongside real-life relative character married multiple times series\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... a mission, or possibly the bit character he has a fling with before the mission even starts and is only present in that one scene. More often than not, the first woman he sleeps with is killed while the second survives. As an overall statistic, as of No ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CartwrightCurse\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... than \\\"B\\\" pictures and failed to push his star to the next level. Additionally, T